    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d113">

                <pb facs="0113" n="103" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg103"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01/10–649: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The United States Representative at the United
                        Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Austin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-10-06T19:35:00-05:00">October 6,
                            1949—7:35 p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 8:08 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1237. From the Secretary. At meeting with Bevin and Couve de Murville<anchor
                        n="86" xml:id="d113-f1"/> today, former referred to our discussions of
                    Chinese situation last month, and said he did not believe there was anything
                    more we can do at this time. I pointed out that we had agreed to move slowly and
                    not to take action without consulting each other. I added <pb facs="0114"
                        n="104" xml:id="pg104"/> that Chinese Communist government had been set up
                    only few days ago and there seemed no reason for haste on our part.</p>
                <p>Bevin mentioned that State Department was being kept fully informed in regard to
                    plans of British Ambassador to China.<anchor n="87" xml:id="d113-f2"/>
                    [Acheson.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Austin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d113-f1" n="86" xml:id="d113-f1-content">
